  "question": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>AB</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> is an interhalogen T-shaped molecule. The number of lone pairs of electrons on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> is (Integer answer)",
